/etc/nginx/sites-available/alumnes<pre><code>server {
    listen 80;
    server_name alumnes.institut.local;
    root /var/www/alumnes;
    index index.php;

    location / {
        try_files $uri $uri/ =404;
    }
    location ~ \.php$ {
        include snippets/fastcgi-php.conf;
        fastcgi_pass unix:/run/php/php8.3-fpm.sock;
    }
    location = /config.php { deny all; }
}
</code></pre> <p>Nginx no executa PHP: li passa els <code>.php</code> a PHP-FPM pel socket (<code>fastcgi_pass</code>).</p>

